Upstream-Status: Not submitted
Applies-To: ONNX Runtime v1.23.1
Reason: ORT tensors expose contiguous logical storage, but the MIGraphX EP can
        bind packed outputs whose compiled graph shapes retain transposed
        strides directly to ORT output buffers. Normalize those outputs using
        only the installed MIGraphX public API and version the MXR cache
        namespace so pre-patch programs are not reused.
Risk: Non-standard packed outputs are staged through host memory after MIGraphX
      execution. Padded and broadcast output layouts fail explicitly. Validate
      provider placement and numeric output before using benchmark results.

diff --git a/onnxruntime/core/providers/migraphx/migraphx_execution_provider.cc b/onnxruntime/core/providers/migraphx/migraphx_execution_provider.cc
--- a/onnxruntime/core/providers/migraphx/migraphx_execution_provider.cc
